  "basis": [
    "The second member calls address 0x80016134 and the first complete body starts at file 0x65B134, independently fixing delta 0x7F9BB000.",
    "Raw common-code direct jumps, including two js to one physical jr ra return, independently agree with that exact delta.",
    "The proven extent is deliberately restricted to the imported root pointer word plus the complete two-member code cohort. No loader read extent or runtime transfer is claimed.",
    "The callback_050 slot is declared int-returning in shared/town_services.h; the first member now explicitly returns that value as u32. The caller passes two ignored parameters. The isolated candidate reproduced all 18 words before joining."
